{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:54:19+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:54:19+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Munters Group AB (publ)","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Pollution & Treatment Controls","country":"Sweden","city":"Kista","website":"https://www.munters.com","employees":5511,"summary":"Munters Group AB (publ) provides climate solutions in the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and Asia-pacific. The company operates through three segments: AirTech, Data Center Technologies, and FoodTech. It offers industrial and commercial dehumidification and climate control products, such as air cleaning and inlet systems, air pollution control and VOC abatement solutions, controllers and automations, coolers and humidifiers, dehumidifiers, fans, heaters, heat exchangers, mass transfer equipment, and mist eliminators. The company also provides lifecycle solutions, including service agreements, installation, start-up, commissioning, maintenance and repairs, and retrofit and upgrade. In addition, it offers its products for cold storage, cooling, dehumidification, farm management, gas liquid separation, high temperature, humidification, mass transfer, preservation, spray drying, and volatile organic compound abatement solutions. The company serves automotive, battery, chemical and fertilizer, construction and infrastructure, data centers, defense and aerospace, electronics, food and agriculture, general industry, healthcare, ice rinks and sports, and marine; oil, gas, and refineries; pharmaceuticals; power; public buildings and offices; pulp, paper, and printing; steel and cement; storage, archives, and museums; and water and wastewater industries. Munters Group AB (publ) was founded in 1955 and is headquartered in Kista, Sweden.","exchange":"Stockholm","currency":"SEK","financial_currency":"SEK","summary_fr":"Munters Group AB (publ) fournit des solutions climatiques dans les Amériques, en Europe, au Moyen-Orient, en Afrique et en Asie-Pacifique. La société opère à travers trois segments: AirTech, Data Center Technologies et FoodTech. Il propose des produits industriels et commerciaux de déshumidification et de climatisation, tels que des systèmes de nettoyage et d'admission d'air, des solutions de réduction de la pollution atmosphérique et des COV, des contrôleurs et des automatismes, des refroidisseurs et des humidificateurs, des déshumidificateurs, des ventilateurs, des chauffages, des échangeurs de chaleur, des équipements de transfert de masse et des éliminateurs de brouillard."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":25254608896,"shares_outstanding":182541440,"trailing_pe":47.87197,"forward_pe":17.380653,"price_to_book":4.460314,"ev_to_ebitda":20.206,"ev_to_revenue":2.141,"dividend_yield":0.0113,"payout_ratio":0.5542,"beta_yahoo":0.743},"targets":{"current_price":138.35,"mean":199.125,"median":197.5,"high":218.0,"low":180.0,"n_analysts":8,"reco_mean":1.375,"reco_key":"strong_buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-23"],"eps_avg":1.74857,"eps_low":1.68,"eps_high":1.79318,"revenue_avg":5136888970,"ex_dividend":"2026-11-04","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.00179,"institutions_pct":0.79691005,"institutions_float_pct":0.79834,"institutions_n":162,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0001,"shares":20385,"value":2820264,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":1.0}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.010299999,"shares":1908079,"value":263982741,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0069,"shares":1276675,"value":176627994,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0036000002},{"name":"T. ROWE PRICE Intl Fd.S, INC.-T. Rowe Price Intl Discovery Fd.","pct":0.0069,"shares":1269805,"value":175677529,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.025899999},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EA